    "title": "Fest of Fall returns to Posse Grounds - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Joseph K Giddens ,\n11 hours ago The city of Sedona’s Fest of Fall returns for its second year to Posse Grounds Park on Saturday, Nov. 8, from 1 to 8 p.m. This year’s event promises to be one of the most eclectic celebrations from Parks and Recreation, blending elements of now retired events such as Rotary’s Oktoberfest and the city of Sedona’s Food Truck Festival. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
